 [:db/cas 17592186198580 :question/problem "![](images/b8/b8874b14fa80881e69cb1daee180d2e342a27c5902e66fc75d43622278176b09.png)\n\nConsider the square region $Δ$ in the $uv$-plane, given by\n\n$$\nΔ=\\{(u,v)\\,:\\,1\\le u\\le \\sqrt{2},\\,\\,\\frac{\\pi }{6}\\le v\\le \\frac{\\pi }{3}\\},\n$$\n\nand the transformation $T,$ given by\n\n$$\nT:(u,v)\\to (u\\operatorname{cos}⁡v,\\,u\\operatorname{sin}⁡v).\n$$\n\nThe image of the bottom side of $Δ$ under the action of $T$ is a line segment. Which of the following statements are true regarding the image?\n\nI. The image makes the angle of $\\frac{\\pi }{6}$ with the positive $x$-axis.\n\nII. The image makes the angle of $\\frac{\\pi }{3}$ with the positive $x$-axis.\n\nIII. The endpoints of the image lie on the circles of radii $1$ and $2$ centered at $O.$" "![](images/b8/b8874b14fa80881e69cb1daee180d2e342a27c5902e66fc75d43622278176b09.png)\n\nConsider the square region $Δ$ in the $uv$-plane, given by\n\n$$\nΔ=\\{(u,v)\\,:\\,1\\le u\\le \\sqrt{2},\\,\\,\\frac{\\pi }{6}\\le v\\le \\frac{\\pi }{3}\\},\n$$\n\nand the transformation $T,$ given by\n\n$$\nT:(u,v)\\to (u\\operatorname{cos}⁡v,\\,u\\operatorname{sin}⁡v).\n$$\n\nThe image of the bottom side of $Δ$ under the action of $T$ is a line segment. Which of the following statements are true regarding the image?\n\nI. The image makes the angle of $\\frac{\\pi }{6}$ with the positive $x$-axis.\n\nII. The image makes the angle of $\\frac{\\pi }{3}$ with the positive $x$-axis.\n\nIII. The endpoints of the image lie on the circles of radii $1$ and $2$ centered at $O.$\n\nSelect all that apply.\n\nIf none apply, leave all boxes unchecked."]
